  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">La ciudadan&#xed;a del nororiente promueve la defensa y cumplimiento de los derechos a la paz y la justicia clim&#xe1;tica.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project called &quot;Citizenship of Northeastern Colombia promotes the defence and fulfilment of the rights to peace and climate justice&quot; to be implemented in the departments of Santander, Magdalena Medio and Catatumbo regions, defined the target group as victims, peasants, citizens of urban centers and organisational processes accompanied by the Luis Carlos P&#xe9;rez Lawyers&apos; Collective Corporation (CCALCP). To advance in the materialisation of the public policy set out in the Peace Agreement by state institutions, based on the demands of victims, peasant farmers and civil society in the implementation of points 1, 3, 4 and 5 to confront violence and build peace in territories where the conflict continues. To make progress with communities and the final consumer population in climate justice through access to justice and judicial decisions for the adoption of conservation measures by environmental authorities in favour of the rights to water and the enjoyment of a healthy environment.</narrative>
  </description>
